{
  "info": {
    "name": "video",
    "description": "video 模块完整链路测试：直传、封面、发布、详情、游标分页、分片上传/断点续传/合并，以及异常边界。\n\n运行前置：\n1. 项目已启动（默认 {{base_url}} = http://127.0.0.1:8080），MySQL/Redis 可用；\n2. 从 postman_test 目录运行（newman run video.postman_collection.json），或导入 Postman 后确认 binary/form-data 文件路径；\n3. 按 00 -> 01 -> 02 -> 03 顺序运行，变量会通过 Tests 脚本自动串联；\n4. fixtures/sample.mp4 为 64 字节、带合法 ftyp 头的测试样本，仅用于接口链路验证，不可播放。\n\n分片规则：分片大小固定 5MB，除最后一片外每片必须恰好 5MB，最后一片为剩余字节数；单任务上限 2GB。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 集合级前置脚本：确保基础环境变量存在。",
          "// 受保护请求通过集合级 Bearer Auth 自动携带 {{token}}。",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('base_url', 'http://127.0.0.1:8080');",
          "}",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('token')) {",
          "  console.log('token 为空：请先运行 00-鉴权准备');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "primary_username",
      "value": "video_demo",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "primary_password",
      "value": "Passw0rd123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "author_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "video_url",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "cover_url",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "video_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "video_id_2",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "upload_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "chunk_size",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "total_chunks",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "error_upload_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "hash_upload_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "merged_video_url",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "next_cursor_last_vid",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "next_cursor_last_created_at",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00-鉴权准备",
      "description": "注册一个本次运行专属的测试账号并登录，后续请求通过集合级 Bearer Auth 自动携带 {{token}}。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "注册测试账号",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_name\": \"{{primary_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{primary_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "前置：用户名 3-32 位字母/数字/下划线，密码至少 8 位且同时包含字母和数字。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// 每次运行生成唯一用户名，避免与历史数据冲突",
                  "const suffix = Date.now().toString().slice(-8);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('primary_username', 'video_' + suffix);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('primary_password', 'Passw0rd123');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('author_id', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('video_url', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cover_url', '');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回 user_id', () => pm.expect(json.data.user_id).to.be.a('number'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('author_id', String(json.data.user_id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登录获取 Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_name\": \"{{primary_username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{primary_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回 access/refresh token', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.refresh_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.data.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "查询作者 ID（备用）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/user/find_by_username",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "find_by_username"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_name\": \"{{primary_username}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "若“注册测试账号”失败但账号已存在，可单独运行本请求补齐 author_id。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "// 注册响应丢失作者 ID 时，可从用户资料补齐",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('author_id', String(json.data.id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01-视频直传",
      "description": "小文件直传链路：上传视频文件 -> 上传封面 -> 发布视频 -> 查询详情/列表。fixtures 路径相对于 postman_test 目录。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "上传视频文件",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/upload_video",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "upload_video"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "fixtures/sample.mp4"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "multipart/form-data，字段名必须为 file。直传上限 100MB，服务端会嗅探真实 MIME，仅接受 mp4/avi/mov/mkv。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回可访问的视频相对路径', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.video_url).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.video_url).to.match(/^\\/upload\\/videos\\/\\d+\\/.+/);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('video_url', json.data.video_url);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "上传封面文件",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/upload_cover",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "upload_cover"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "fixtures/avatar.png"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "multipart/form-data，字段名必须为 file。封面上限 10MB，仅接受 jpg/jpeg/png/webp。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回可访问的封面相对路径', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.cover_url).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.cover_url).to.match(/^\\/upload\\/covers\\/\\d+\\/.+/);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cover_url', json.data.cover_url);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "发布视频",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/publish",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "publish"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"postman video\",\n  \"description\": \"created by video.postman_collection.json\",\n  \"video_url\": \"{{video_url}}\",\n  \"cover_url\": \"{{cover_url}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"go\", \"postman\", \"go\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "video_url 必须以上传接口返回的 /upload/videos/ 开头，cover_url 必须以上传接口返回的 /upload/covers/ 开头；tags 会自动去重。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回 video_id', () => pm.expect(json.data.video_id).to.be.a('number'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('video_id', String(json.data.video_id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "发布第二条视频（分页用）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/publish",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "publish"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"postman video 2\",\n  \"description\": \"second video for cursor pagination\",\n  \"video_url\": \"{{video_url}}\",\n  \"cover_url\": \"{{cover_url}}\",\n  \"tags\": [\"postman\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('video_id_2', String(json.data.video_id));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "获取视频详情",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/{{video_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "{{video_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "软鉴权接口：不传 token 也能访问，is_liked 恒为 false。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回目标视频', () => pm.expect(String(json.data.video_id)).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('video_id')));",
                  "pm.test('游客 is_liked=false', () => pm.expect(json.data.is_liked).to.eql(false));",
                  "pm.test('包含作者信息', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.author.user_id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.author).to.have.property('user_name');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "获取视频列表（首页）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/list?author_id={{author_id}}&page_size=1",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "list"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "author_id",
                  "value": "{{author_id}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "复合游标 (created_at, id) 分页。page_size 上限为 20，超出会被钳制。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回视频数组与总数', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.videos).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.total).to.be.at.least(1);",
                  "});",
                  "const cursor = json.data.next_cursor;",
                  "if (cursor) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('next_cursor_last_vid', cursor.last_vid);",
                  "  // created_at 含时区符号，必须编码后再拼进 query",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('next_cursor_last_created_at', encodeURIComponent(cursor.last_created_at));",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('next_cursor_last_vid', '');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('next_cursor_last_created_at', '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "获取视频列表（下一页）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/list?author_id={{author_id}}&page_size=1&cursor.last_vid={{next_cursor_last_vid}}&cursor.last_created_at={{next_cursor_last_created_at}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "list"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "author_id",
                  "value": "{{author_id}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor.last_vid",
                  "value": "{{next_cursor_last_vid}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor.last_created_at",
                  "value": "{{next_cursor_last_created_at}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "若首页返回 next_cursor 为空，本请求等价于首页；last_vid 与 last_created_at 必须同时提供。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('下一页不重复第一页视频', () => {",
                  "  const ids = json.data.videos.map(v => String(v.video_id));",
                  "  pm.expect(ids).to.not.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('video_id'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02-分片上传（断点续传）",
      "description": "完整分片链路：创建会话 -> 查询状态 -> 上传分片 -> 再次查询 -> 合并 -> 会话清理。示例文件为 64 字节，因此只有 1 个分片。真实大文件每片固定 5MB（最后一片为剩余大小）。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "创建分片上传会话",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/chunk/create",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "chunk",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"filename\": \"sample.mp4\",\n  \"file_size\": 64,\n  \"file_hash\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "file_hash 可选：填写后合并时会强制校验整文件 sha256。file_size 必须与实际文件字节数一致。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(200));",
                  "pm.test('返回会话元数据', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.upload_id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.chunk_size).to.eql(5242880);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.total_chunks).to.eql(1);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('upload_id', json.data.upload_id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('chunk_size', String(json.data.chunk_size));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('total_chunks', String(json.data.total_chunks));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "查询上传状态（续传前）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/video/chunk/status?upload_id={{upload_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "video",
                "chunk",
                "status"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "upload_id",
                  "value": "{{upload_id}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "前端据此只补传 uploaded 中缺失的分片下标。"
          },
          "event": [
